Hello Venkat,

currently there is not much you or we can do about this issue. The proto package is not very high on our list of priorities as few packages depend on it, at least if you exclude all the gg* packages like ggplot2 which are related to graphics and which Renjin does not support.

However, the proto package is a small and pure R code package with no dependencies therefore Renjin should be able to run this package. The fact that it doesn't at the moment is a sign that there is some incompatibility with GNU R. We will try and investigate this as soon as possible.

Sorry that we couldn't be of more help with this at the moment!

Maarten-Jan

